name": "06 Screenshot 1 _ 2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1595315541915006", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620630_1595315545248339_1520943916646723537_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b1x_kTwLgyUQ7kNvwHd2dMz&_nc_oc=AdqCzxFHJYFPqjmRFOhIwtxJSWzny-lYa3VmUChn83mZCxkQ2X3iBcu0-24-6QxlEVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtuhyB6doVNy-HO6fH0xEO9S3oF_cVGN82MWJhSKz2ZA&oe=6AFB3CC7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "16_trailer_cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "1111896371638112", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623551_1111896374971445_8889879734862758378_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GbnGmhuLEVAQ7kNvwFF9D9w&_nc_oc=AdrToo0U2vy-IbF8-pLSVzXQ6p27dPVLzCOaXU5xcZqhMbAlwpJ-79BaRZwtB-1ftto&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRzci4GigrUD3QhU-T8bCHL2y3hpiQFZdPwvaY0ZW_k3A&oe=6AFB1ACE"}, "display_name": "Fire Safety Essentials", "keywords": ["Fire", "Safety", "Training", "Extinguisher", "AutoVRse"], "long_description": "A fire extinguisher only helps if you know how to use it, which one to pick, and when to put it down and leave. Fire Safety Essentials teaches all three in a VR experience set in an industrial warehouse.\n\nYou start with a small fire on a stack of wood panels and learn the PASS method hands-on: pull the pin, aim at the base of the fire, squeeze the trigger and sweep from side to side, standing 6\u20138 feet back behind a marked line. Next, you see the four situations where an extinguisher is the wrong answer: a fire bigger than you, thick smoke, an exit about to be cut off, and a fire you can't identify.\n\nThen you learn the five fire classes with a simple mnemonic, \"Always Bring Coffee, Don't Kick\": Ash, Boil, Circuit, Dense metals and Kitchen. For each class you match the right extinguisher to the fuel and put the fire out yourself.\n\nWHAT YOU PRACTISE\n\u2022 The PASS method on a live fire, with a guided safe-distance line\n\u2022 Recognising when to evacuate instead of fighting the fire\n\u2022 Class A, B, C, D and K fires and what fuels each one\n\u2022 Choosing between water, foam, CO2, dry powder and wet chemical extinguishers\n\u2022 Raising the fire alarm first, and why power must be cut on an electrical fire\n\nCHECK YOUR KNOWLEDGE\nAn 11-question quiz tests extinguisher choice, fire classes, the PASS steps and when to walk away.\n\nBuilt by AutoVRse for teams that want fire safety training people actually remember.", "short_description": "Learn to fight a workplace fire the right way, without the danger. In a virtual warehouse you put out a fire using the PASS method, learn the four situations where you should walk away instead, then work through all five fire classes, A, B, C, D and K, choosing the right extinguisher for each. A short quiz checks what you've learned. A VR training experience from AutoVRse."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs-vrsebuilder.autovrse.app/privacy/fire-safety-essentials", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AutoVRse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://autovrse.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1136753322172596"}}]}, "sched